  "comments": "<p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5ca9fffc965a3.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5ca9fffc965a3.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/67dc2c359869f.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/67dc2c359869f.jpg\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/67d460145714e.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/67d460145714e.jpg\"></a></p><p>Multiple years exists with and without beads, including 1933, 1935, 1938 and 1946. Some coins exhibit faint tracing of beads.<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/581464b430902.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/581464b430902.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/581464bf2c47f.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/581464bf2c47f.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5ef2d391e64f2.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5ef2d391e64f2.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5ef2d3b826904.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5ef2d3b826904.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5ef2d3cc5ba6e.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5ef2d3cc5ba6e.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><br><br><br><strong>Note: Small letter H on the reverse is not a mintmark. All the coins of 1918-1924, with this letter or without it, were minted in Bogotá</strong><br><br>For the 1946 dated coins:13,423,000 were minted in the Philadelphia Mint and 26,577,000 were minted in the San Francisco Mint (3,330,000 in 1946 and 23,247,000 in 1947).<br><br>Varieties exist for 1950 B: small 50 in date, large 50 in date (scarce), and very large 50 in date (rare).</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><u>Note: varieties exist for 1941 B: small mintmark B, big minmark B</u></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/683b7060a6b63.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/683b7060a6b63.jpg\"></a></p>",
